2026-08-16T12:41:53Z    [DE:Worldwide net sales and revenues] GATE critic: You averaged in a -16.8% YoY change for FY2023Q3→FY2024Q3 that doesn’t match the same metric/basis as the anchor. The only sourced figure here is Q3’25 worldwide net sales and revenues ($12,018m, down 9%). There’s no evidence that worldwide net sales and revenues fell 16.8% in Q3’24 vs Q3’23; that rate likely pertains to a different basis (e.g., equipment net sales or a nine‑month figure). Mixing a quarter-level worldwide net sales/revenues change with a non-comparable -16.8% produced the -12.69% you applied, so the forecast rests on the wrong basis.
