2026-08-16T12:43:51Z    [ADI:Adjusted gross margin] GATE critic: The 71.95% “last 4 reported” base is mis-specified: you averaged 69.9, 71.6, 74.1, and 72.2, which are the prior-year and current-year comparatives from two Q3 rows (per your own evidence: “71.6% | 69.9%” and “72.2% | 74.1%”), duplicated across FY2020Q3/FY2021Q3 and FY2022Q3/FY2023Q3. That mixes current and prior-year figures and does not represent the last four sequential quarters, so the 72.55% result rests on the wrong period/basis.
